@@@!atrep

@@/ at-tei: a syntax mapper for TEI P5, built on the
@@/ bibliogramma pattern scaled up - a small set of form sims
@@/ with the TEI element or type identity carried in
@@/ vocabulary-bound genoses (TEI's own names, lowercased to
@@/ the genos grammar; the tei exo restores camelCase). Terms
@@/ outside the vocabularies pass through, so uncommon
@@/ elements ride as free genoses rather than failing.
@@/ Convention: a document is a teiheader block (fields)
@@/ followed by a text block. The reverse morphism into
@@/ litogramma awaits genos-dispatched morphism rules
@@/ (spec follow-up); litogramma INTO at-tei works today via
@@/ renames with genoses.
@@/ The unseen attributes (who, ref, target, when, ana) ride
@@/ the at-aphanes monosims inside the annotated span; the tei
@@/ exo reads them through sim-name slots.

@@::at-aphanes

@=== division
@#[(taxis)] [lemma]
grammata
#@
@% divisions
@"nested division (div/front/back families); head is the lemma"@
===@

@=== verse
@~ [lemma]
stichos
~@ [hypograph]
@"line group (lg); the hypograph is an attribution"@
===@

@=== speech
@: [lemma]
grammata
:@
@"drama speech (sp); the speaker is the lemma"@
===@

@=== stage-direction
@:( grammata ):@
@"inline stage direction"@
===@

@=== block
@_[(taxis)] [lemma]
grammata
_@ [hypograph]
@% blocks
@"generic block element; genos names it, bibl rides hypograph"@
===@

@=== phrase
@, grammata ,@
@% phrases
@"generic inline element; the genos names it (emph, said, ...)"@
===@

@=== note
@^
grammata
^@
@% notes
@"note body (deixis callouts mark anchors); genos is the place"@
===@

@=== list
@--
grammata
--@
@% lists
@"list element; the genos is the type"@
===@

@=== item
@- [lemma]
grammata
-@
@"list item; a gloss label rides the lemma"@
===@

@=== table
@+[(taxis)] [lemma]
stichos
+@
@"table; one row per stichos, cells pipe-separated"@
===@

@=== figure
@<[(taxis)] [lemma]
grammata
<@
@"figure; grammata holds the enmedia, the head is the lemma"@
===@

@=== link
@>< grammata ><@
@"external pointer (ref/ptr with a remote target)"@
===@

@=== ref
@>(target)
@"internal pointer to an onymized element"@
===@

@=== milestone
@|(n)
@% milestones
@"empty milestone element (lb, pb, cb); the genos names it"@
===@

@=== field
@= lemma=fields
grammata
=@
@"header field inside the teiheader block; the lemma names it"@
===@

@==% divisions
front:
back:
book:
part:
chapter:
section:
subsection:
act:
